<title>HONG KONG: China Resources unit sets US$175 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>China Resources unit sets US$175 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Resources Enterprises unit's US$175 million floating rate note issue is now in general syndication, bankers said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CRE FINANCE (1997) LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  CHINA RESOURCES ENTERPRISES LTD</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$175 MLN COUPON     6ML+62 BP  MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	  ISS PRICE  PAR	  LAUNCH  06.MAR.97</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	 CALLS	NONE	 REPLIES 20.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING    LUXEMBOURG REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS  US$100k</p>
<p> RATING     NONE	 SALE LMTS  STANDARD   TAX PROV --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  CHINA	GOV LAW    ENGLISH    PAY DATE --</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	  CO-LEADS   US$10 MLN  50 BP ALL-IN 72 BP</p>
<p>	  MANAGERS   US$7-9 MLN 40 BP ALL-IN 70 BP</p>
<p>	  CO-MGRS    US$5-6 MLN 25 BP ALL-IN 67 BP</p>
<p> ARRANGER   ING BARINGS</p>
<p>CO-ARRANGERS BNP HONG KONG, DRESDNER KLEINWORT BENSON, SANWA</p>
<p>		  INTERNATIONAL FINANCE, SCHRODERS ASIA AND WESTLB</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
